<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kia Steel 1996 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Kia Steel 1996 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (In billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			    89.54  vs     70.68</p>
<p>    Turnover			   320.67  vs    282.14</p>
<p>    Loss before tax		   89.54  vs     70.68</p>
<p>    Extrordinary	     (loss)  1.65  vs(gain)0.22</p>
<p>Note - Kia Steel Co Ltd is an affiliate of Kia Motors Corp. The company's share capital rose by 6.0 million shares to 27.97 million at the end of calendar 1996 due to rights issue offers.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
